  {L"卸载当前用户的 FolderNote（通用版及 Win11 首层菜单版），移除双击导航扩展及右键菜单？\n\n移除自动加载注册可能需要管理员授权。所有文件夹中的备注都会保留。", L"Uninstall FolderNote for the current user, including the standard and Windows 11 menu editions, double-click navigation, and context menu commands?\n\nRemoving the Explorer extension registration may require administrator approval. Existing folder notes will be kept."},
  {L"移除 FolderNote 和右键菜单？已保存的文件夹备注会保留。", L"Remove FolderNote and its context menu commands? Existing folder notes will be kept."},
  {L"无法启动卸载", L"Could not start the uninstaller"},
