  {L"通用版卸载已执行，但 Win11 应用包未能移除。请在 Windows 设置 → 应用中卸载“FolderNote 文件夹备注”。备注数据未删除。", L"The standard edition was removed. To remove the Windows 11 app package, uninstall FolderNote from Windows Settings → Apps. Existing notes were kept."},
  {L"已卸载。所有文件夹备注均已保留。", L"FolderNote was uninstalled. Existing folder notes were kept."},
  {L"右键菜单已移除，文件夹备注已保留。以下程序文件仍在使用，请关闭相关窗口或注销后删除：\n{0}", L"Context menu commands were removed and existing notes were kept. Close the related windows or sign out before deleting these files:\n{0}"},
  {L"请完整解压安装包，保持 Install.exe、FolderNote.exe、FolderNoteShell.dll、FolderNoteNavigation.dll 和 Uninstall.exe 在同一文件夹。", L"Extract the complete package. Keep Install.exe, FolderNote.exe, FolderNoteShell.dll, FolderNoteNavigation.dll, and Uninstall.exe in the same folder."},
  {L"FolderNote 系统工具", L"FolderNote system tools"},
  {L"安装完成。从开始菜单搜索“FolderNote 设置”调整功能和主题。首次安装默认开启双击返回上一级，备注和中键快速定位默认关闭。覆盖升级保留已有选择、备注、置顶和历史记录。\n\n新版使用独立目录，不受旧文件占用影响。安装器不会注销或重启资源管理器；请关闭并重新打开文件夹窗口以加载新版扩展。\n\n通用版右键菜单在 Windows 11 的“显示更多选项”中；首层菜单请使用 Win11 安装包。", L"Installation complete. Search Start for FolderNote to adjust features and appearance. On first install, double-click navigation is enabled. Folder notes and quick folders are optional. Upgrades keep your settings, notes, pins, and history.\n\nClose and reopen folder windows to load the updated Explorer extension.\n\nOn Windows 11, the standard edition's context menu commands are under “Show more options.” Use the Windows 11 installer for top-level commands."},
