  {L"请完整解压 Win11 安装包，并保持所有程序文件在同一文件夹。", L"Extract the complete Windows 11 package and keep all program files in the same folder."},
  {L"Win11 应用包必须安装到当前账户。请使用当前账户的管理员授权；不能用另一管理员账户的凭据代替。通用版安装器支持另一管理员授权。", L"Install the Windows 11 package using administrator approval for your current account. Use the standard installer if you need to approve with another administrator account."},
  {L"安装未成功。需要 Windows 11；组织策略也可能禁止未签名测试包。未修改系统安全设置。", L"Installation failed. This package requires Windows 11. Your organization's policies may block unsigned test packages."},
  {L"Win11 菜单包已安装，但双击导航组件安装未完成。请重新运行安装器。", L"The Windows 11 menu package was installed. Run the installer again to complete installation of the navigation extension."},
  {L"FolderNote 系统工具已安装，备注、双击导航和中键快速定位可独立开启或关闭；支持浅色、深色和跟随系统。\n\n无需注销；关闭并重新打开文件夹窗口后，导航扩展会自动加载。在开始菜单搜索“FolderNote 设置”。首次安装默认开启双击返回上一级，备注和中键快速定位默认关闭；开启备注后才显示相关右键菜单。\n\n覆盖升级保留已有选择。若旧版开启后仍无反应，请重新保存一次双击导航设置。\n\n菜单排序由 Windows 决定。", L"FolderNote is installed. Folder notes, double-click navigation, and quick folders can be enabled independently. Choose a light, dark, or system theme in settings.\n\nClose and reopen folder windows to load the extension. Search Start for FolderNote. On first install, double-click navigation is enabled. Enable folder notes to show their context menu commands.\n\nUpgrades keep your settings. If navigation does not respond, save your double-click navigation setting again.\n\nWindows controls the menu order."},
